# An allowlist keeps credentials, host dependencies and test tooling out.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!apps/
!apps/api/
!apps/api/src/
!apps/api/src/**
!docker/
!docker/**/
!docker/**/Dockerfile
!docker/**/go.mod
!docker/**/go.sum
!docker/python/debian.sources
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
